<title>POLAND: FARMFOOD MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>FARMFOOD MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.68 vs   1.83</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.60 vs   2.33</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.80 vs   2.88</p>
<p> Sales		   21.82 vs  17.31</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.23 vs   3.43</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.35 vs   4.63</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.73 vs   6.08</p>
<p> Sales		   57.00 vs  47.97</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat processing company is Farm</p>
<p>Food SA.</p>
